SUMMARY:Gabriel Rutledge LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DTSTAMP:20260821T033716Z
DTSTART:20260821T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nGabriel Rutledge is a nationally touring stand-up comedian known for 
	his sharp\, self-aware humor and his ability to find comedy in the most re
	latable corners of everyday life. Based in the Pacific Northwest\, Rutledg
	e has been a fixture on the comedy club circuit for over 15 years. \nHis c
	omedy style is clean\, clever\, and deeply observational — drawing from hi
	s experiences as a husband\, father\, and regular guy navigating a world t
	hat never quite makes sense. Gabriel has a natural ease on stage that make
	s audiences feel like they’re hanging out with a funny friend rather than 
	watching a performance. \nHe has performed at top venues including Brad Ga
	rrett’s Comedy Club at MGM Grand in Las Vegas\, Cap City Comedy Club in Au
	stin\, and Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club in San Antonio. His Houston debut at
	 Punch Line is not to be missed. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 
	21\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Housto
	n\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18
	+ (2 Beverage Minimum per person)\nTicket Prices: $38 – $50 (fees included
	)\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s top comedy 
	club\, located at 1204 Caroline Street. This Live Nation-operated venue is
	 known for its intimate atmosphere and world-class lineup of national come
	dians performing year-round. \nThe club’s general admission layout ensures
	 every guest has a great view of the stage\, with preferred seating upgrad
	es available for those who want to be front and center. The full bar and 2
	-beverage minimum create a lively\, social atmosphere perfect for a Friday
	 night out. \nParking is easy — valet service is available at most shows\,
	 and the Green Street garage on Clay between Main and Fannin offers surfac
	e and garage parking with skybridge access. The venue is cashless\, accept
	ing all major credit and debit cards. \nWhat to Expect\nGabriel Rutledge d
	elivers a polished\, crowd-pleasing set that works for everyone from comed
	y veterans to first-timers. His Friday night early show is the ideal way t
	o kick off the weekend with genuine\, feel-good laughs. \nDoors open at 6:
	00 PM\, giving you time to settle in and order drinks before the show begi
	ns at 7:00 PM. A late show at 9:15 PM is also available. The performance r
	uns approximately 90 minutes. \nSaturday August 22 shows are also availabl
	e (7:00 PM and 9:15 PM) for those who can’t make Friday. All shows are 18+
	 with a 2-beverage minimum. No cell phones or recording devices permitted 
	during the performance. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from $38 
	to $50 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). Buy official tickets
	 through Ticketmaster or find resale options on VividSeats. \nOfficial Tic
	ketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a com
	mission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/gabri
	el-rutledge-live-at-punch-line-houston/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gabriel-rutledge-live-at-punch-line-ho
	uston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\,
	 United States
