DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nJosh Blue LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacr
	amento\nEmmy-nominated comedian Josh Blue brings his hilarious stand-up to
	 Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento on August 21\, 2026! Winner of NBC’s
	 Last Comic Standing\, Josh Blue is known for his self-deprecating humor a
	bout living with cerebral palsy and his fearless\, laugh-out-loud comedy s
	tyle. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doo
	rs open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 
	2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid go
	vernment-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout
	 Josh Blue\nJosh Blue is a stand-up comedian best known for winning Season
	 4 of NBC’s Last Comic Standing. His comedy centers on his experiences liv
	ing with cerebral palsy\, delivered with infectious energy and self-deprec
	ating humor that has won over audiences worldwide. He has appeared on nume
	rous TV shows and continues to tour extensively across the country. \nWhat
	 to Expect\n\nAward-winning stand-up comedy from the winner of Last Comic 
	Standing\nFearless self-deprecating humor and infectious energy\nUnique pe
	rspective on life with cerebral palsy\nIntimate club atmosphere at Sacrame
	nto’s premier comedy venue\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\n\nVe
	nue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Ar
	den Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern Califo
	rnia\, it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking 
	in the shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $38. 
	This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are ava
	ilable through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficia
	l Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a
	 commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to 
	you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID m
	ay be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-blue-li
	ve-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-blue-live-at-punch-line-comedy-cl
	ub-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\
	, CA\, 95825
