SUMMARY:Alfred Robles: Vatos with Gatos Tour LIVE at Houston Improv
DTSTAMP:20260821T033716Z
DTSTART:20260821T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Alfred Robles\nAlfred Ro
	bles is one of the hottest comedians in the country. After getting kicked 
	out of the police academy\, he rose to become a nationally recognized stan
	d-up star. He was the only comedian featured on all 3 seasons of Stand Up 
	Revolution on Comedy Central\, appeared on Netflix’s Mr. Iglesias\, and wa
	s featured on HBO’s Entre Nos. Alfred has toured worldwide with Gabriel Ig
	lesias and was one of the first comedians to perform at Dodger Stadium. \n
	His Vatos with Gatos Tour is his biggest headline run yet — a hilarious\, 
	high-energy show packed with his signature storytelling\, crowd work\, and
	 the kind of relatable humor that has earned him a 4.8-star rating from fa
	ns across the country. Don’t miss him live in Houston. \nEvent Details\nDa
	te: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (Late show at 9:45 PM al
	so available)\nVenue: Houston Improv\nAddress: 7620 Katy Freeway #455\, Ho
	uston\, TX 77024\nAge Restriction: 18+\nTicket Price: From $79 \nAbout Hou
	ston Improv\nHouston Improv is one of Houston’s most beloved comedy clubs\
	, located at 7620 Katy Freeway inside City Centre. Part of the legendary I
	mprov Comedy Club chain\, it has hosted some of the biggest names in stand
	-up comedy for decades. The club features a full-service bar\, dinner menu
	\, and an intimate stage setup that puts every seat close to the action. \
	nThe venue has a lively\, welcoming atmosphere perfect for a night out. Wi
	th table seating\, great sightlines\, and a two-drink minimum\, it’s the i
	deal setting for Alfred’s crowd-driven\, high-energy performance style. Pa
	rking is available in the City Centre complex. \nWhat to Expect\nAlfred Ro
	bles delivers a non-stop laugh fest from start to finish. His shows are kn
	own for incredible crowd interaction\, hilarious personal stories\, and a 
	warmth that makes the entire room feel like family. Fans consistently rate
	 his live performances as some of the best comedy experiences they’ve ever
	 had. \nAlfred performs a full weekend run at Houston Improv — Friday Aug 
	21 at 7:30 PM and 9:45 PM\, Saturday Aug 22 at 7:00 PM and 9:30 PM\, and S
	unday Aug 23 at 7:30 PM. This is an 18+ event. \nTicket Information\nPrice
	: From $79\nTickets available via Ticketmaster/TicketWeb (official) or Viv
	idSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains af
	filiate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps:
	//comedycalendar.com/event/alfred-robles-vatos-with-gatos-tour-live-at-hou
	ston-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/alfred-robles-vatos-with-gatos-tour-li
	ve-at-houston-improv/
LOCATION:Houston Improv\, 7620 Katy Freeway\, Houston\, TX\, 77024\, United
	 States
