	arp multicultural observations and high-energy performances. A Las Vegas r
	esident\, Peters has sold out arenas across six continents and has multipl
	e Netflix specials to his name. His RELAX World Tour continues his traditi
	on of delivering laugh-out-loud comedy that resonates with audiences every
