	star\nSharp multicultural humor and observational comedy\nHigh-energy perf
	ormance in an intimate theater setting\nTwo exclusive Las Vegas performanc
	es only\nPremium theater experience at the iconic Wynn Las Vegas\nApproxim
	ately 90 minutes of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\nThe Encore Theater
	 at Wynn Las Vegas is one of the most prestigious entertainment venues on 
	the Strip\, known for hosting world-class comedy and music acts in an inti
	mate\, luxurious setting. Located inside the award-winning Wynn Las Vegas 
	resort\, the theater offers exceptional sightlines and premium amenities. 
	\nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $75 to $150. This i
	s an 18+ event. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or V
	ividSeats (resale). The median ticket price is approximately $126. \nOffic
