	 you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID 
	may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/russell-pet
	ers-relax-world-tour-live-at-encore-theater-at-wynn-las-vegas/\n\nFrom Com
