DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nKathleen Madigan: Flying Cats & Marching Armadillo
	s Tour LIVE at Music Box at the Borgata\nOne of America’s most beloved sta
	nd-up comedians\, Kathleen Madigan\, brings her  LIVE to Music Box at the 
	Borgata in Atlantic City on Friday\, August 21\, 2026 (with a second show 
	Saturday\, August 22). Known for her hilarious storytelling and relatable 
	humor\, Kathleen Madigan is a must-see live performer. \nEvent Details\nDa
	te: Friday\, August 21\, 2026 (also Saturday\, August 22)Time: 8:00 PM ETV
	enue: Music Box at the BorgataAddress: One Borgata Way\, Atlantic City\, N
	J 08401Doors Open: 7:00 PM \nAbout Kathleen Madigan\nKathleen Madigan is a
	 stand-up comedian with over 30 years of experience and multiple Grammy-no
	minated comedy albums. Known for her appearances on The Tonight Show\, Lat
	e Show with David Letterman\, and her own Netflix specials\, she is one of
	 the most respected voices in stand-up comedy today. \nWhat to Expect\n\nK
	athleen Madigan’s signature storytelling and observational humor\nHilariou
	s takes on family\, politics\, and everyday life\nAn intimate show at the 
	Music Box at the Borgata\nTwo nights available — August 21 and August 22\n
	A perfect summer night out in Atlantic City\n\nVenue Information\n \nTicke
	t Information\nTickets start from $59. Get your seats through official Tic
	ketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale
	 Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales ar
	e final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for 
	entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/kathleen-madigan-flying-cats-ma
	rching-armadillos-tour-live-at-music-box-at-the-borgata/\n\nFrom Comedy Ca
	lendar
