DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nFor You Fest: GenX Takeover Comedy Tour LIVE at
	 Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nThe GenX Takeover Comedy 
	Tour is bringing a powerhouse lineup of comedians to the Great Cedar Showr
	oom at Foxwoods Resort Casino for one unforgettable night on August 21\, 2
	026. This special “For You Fest” edition celebrates Gen X humor with a ros
	ter of hilarious performers who know exactly how to make a crowd roar with
	 laughter. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM
	 (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort C
	asino\nAddress: 39 Norwich Westerly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT 06339\nParkin
	g: On-site parking available at no charge\nAge Requirement: All ages welco
	me (under 14 must be accompanied by an adult) \nAbout GenX Takeover Comedy
	 Tour\nThe GenX Takeover Comedy Tour is a touring comedy showcase celebrat
	ing the humor\, nostalgia\, and irreverence of Generation X. Featuring a r
	otating cast of top comedians including Justin Rupple\, Kelly Manno\, Jojo
	 Malagar\, The Dadbod Veteran\, and more\, this tour has been selling out 
	venues across the country. The “For You Fest” edition at Foxwoods is a spe
	cial one-night-only event packed with laughs. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full e
	vening of stand-up comedy from multiple Gen X comedians\nSharp\, relatable
	 humor about growing up in the 70s\, 80s\, and 90s\nA high-energy show in 
	the intimate Great Cedar Showroom setting\nWorld-class casino resort ameni
	ties before and after the show\nOne-night-only special “For You Fest” form
	at\nTickets starting from $61 — great value for a multi-comedian lineup\n\
	nVenue Information\nThe Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort Casino is 
	one of New England’s premier entertainment venues\, located in Mashantucke
	t\, CT. The intimate showroom offers excellent sightlines and top-notch so
	und\, making it a favorite for comedy and live entertainment. Foxwoods off
	ers world-class dining\, gaming\, and hotel accommodations on-site. \nTick
	et Information\nTickets start at $61 and are available now. This is a one-
	night-only event — don’t miss your chance to see the GenX Takeover Comedy 
	Tour live at Foxwoods. Grab your seats before they sell out! \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a c
	ommission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to yo
	u. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may
	 be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/for-you-fest-g
	enx-takeover-comedy-tour-live-at-great-cedar-showroom-at-foxwoods-resort-c
	asino/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/for-you-fest-genx-takeover-comedy-tour
	-live-at-great-cedar-showroom-at-foxwoods-resort-casino/
LOCATION:Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort Casino\, 39 Norwich Wester
	ly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT\, 6339\, United States Of America
