SUMMARY:Leanne Morgan: THE TIME OF OUR LIVES TOUR LIVE at The Orpheum Theat
	re Memphis (Saturday)
DTSTAMP:20260821T033716Z
DTSTART:20260822T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLeanne Mo
	rgan is one of the hottest names in stand-up comedy\, beloved for her warm
	\, Southern charm and hilariously relatable humor about marriage\, motherh
	ood\, and middle age. The Tennessee native has taken the comedy world by s
	torm with her authentic\, feel-good style. \nMorgan’s Netflix special and 
	viral social media presence have earned her a massive\, devoted fanbase. H
	er comedy resonates especially with women who see their own lives reflecte
	d in her stories — but her universal appeal brings in audiences of all bac
	kgrounds. \nThe Time of Our Lives Tour features all-new material and marks
	 a triumphant return to Memphis\, where Morgan has previously sold out sho
	ws. This is a three-night run at the Orpheum — don’t miss your chance to s
	ee her live! \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 22\, 2026 \nTime: 7:
	00 PM CDT \nVenue: The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\, 203 S. Main St.\, Memphis
	\, TN 38103 \nNote: This is the Saturday night performance. Friday (Aug 21
	) and Sunday (Aug 23) shows are also available. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Orp
	heum Theatre Memphis is one of the most storied and beautiful performing a
	rts venues in the American South. Built in 1928\, this stunning historic t
	heater seats approximately 2\,300 guests and is renowned for its ornate ar
	chitecture\, crystal chandeliers\, and exceptional acoustics. \nLocated at
	 203 S. Main Street in the heart of downtown Memphis\, the Orpheum is step
	s away from Beale Street and the city’s vibrant entertainment district. Th
	e venue offers orchestra\, mezzanine\, and balcony seating\, with excellen
	t sightlines throughout. \nParking is available in nearby garages and surf
	ace lots. The Orpheum’s intimate atmosphere makes it one of the best place
	s in Memphis to experience live comedy — close enough to feel every punchl
	ine. \nWhat to Expect\nLeanne Morgan performs a solo stand-up set featurin
	g all-new material from The Time of Our Lives Tour. The show is family-fri
	endly and runs approximately 75–90 minutes. \nMorgan’s performances are kn
	own for their warmth\, laughter\, and the feeling that you’re spending an 
	evening with your funniest friend. Expect a joyful\, feel-good night that 
	will have you laughing from start to finish. \nTicket Information\nPrice R
	ange: From $123 and up (fees may apply) \nPurchase official tickets throug
	h Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial Ticke
	tsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commi
	ssion at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/leanne-
	morgan-the-time-of-our-lives-tour-live-at-the-orpheum-theatre-memphis-satu
	rday/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/leanne-morgan-the-time-of-our-lives-to
	ur-live-at-the-orpheum-theatre-memphis-saturday/
LOCATION:The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\, 203 S. Main St.\, Memphis\, TN\, 381
	03\, United States Of America
