DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets \nResale Tickets \nBen Palmer LIVE at The Bell House\nComedian Ben P
	almer takes the stage at The Bell House in Brooklyn\, New York on Saturday
	\, August 22\, 2026 for a night of stand-up comedy. Known for his clever w
	it and engaging stage presence\, Ben Palmer delivers a show that keeps aud
	iences laughing from start to finish. Don’t miss this live comedy performa
	nce at one of Brooklyn’s most beloved venues! \nEvent Details\nDate: Satur
	day\, August 22\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: The Bell House\nAddress: 149
	 7th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215\nParking: Street parking available\; nearby 
	paid lots\nAge Requirement: 18+ (valid photo ID required) \nAbout Ben Palm
	er\nBen Palmer is a stand-up comedian known for his sharp observational hu
	mor and charismatic stage presence. He has performed at comedy clubs and v
	enues across the country\, building a loyal fanbase with his relatable and
	 entertaining style. Ben Palmer’s live shows are known for their energy\, 
	wit\, and crowd interaction that keeps audiences engaged throughout the ni
	ght. \nWhat to Expect\n\nBen Palmer’s sharp\, witty stand-up comedy\nObser
	vational humor and engaging crowd interaction\nAn intimate Brooklyn venue 
	experience at The Bell House\nA fun Saturday night out in Brooklyn\nNon-st
	op laughs in a welcoming\, laid-back atmosphere\n\nVenue Information\nThe 
	Bell House is a beloved Brooklyn music and comedy venue located at 149 7th
	 St in the Gowanus neighborhood. Known for its warm atmosphere\, great sou
	nd\, and intimate setting\, The Bell House is one of NYC’s premier spots f
	or live comedy and music events\, drawing top talent from around the count
	ry. \nTicket Information\nOfficial tickets are available through Ticketmas
	ter. Resale tickets are also available through VividSeats. Seating is gene
	ral admission — arrive early for the best spots. Tickets are limited\, so 
	don’t wait! \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affil
	iate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links
	 at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to cha
	nge. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.c
	om/event/ben-palmer-live-at-the-bell-house/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
